(816607, 91097, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever and very well executed indeed.  I especially love the lighting.</td>', 'Clever and very well executed indeed.  I especially love the lighting.', '2004-07-19 04:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(816610, 90674, 21255, '<td valign="top">ive seen this before</td>', 'ive seen this before', '2004-07-19 04:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(816622, 91366, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good idea or the challenge, great lighting and I think the colours in the bowl are ideal and a good match for the eggs.  The image does seem a little oversharpened though?</td>', 'Good idea or the challenge, great lighting and I think the colours in the bowl are ideal and a good match for the eggs.  The image does seem a little oversharpened though?', '2004-07-19 05:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(816627, 92055, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever, I love it.</td>', 'Clever, I love it.', '2004-07-19 05:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(816628, 91910, 17233, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot - my only criticism is with the lighting. Whilst I like the nice clean background, the key light seems to be casting some overly harsh shadows on the subject. Maybe a fill light in front would have lessened the effect and possibly some more diffusion on the key light. But overall I like this image (7)</td>', 'Gorgeous shot - my only criticism is with the lighting. Whilst I like the nice clean background, the key light seems to be casting some overly harsh shadows on the subject. Maybe a fill light in front would have lessened the effect and possibly some more diffusion on the key light. But overall I like this image (7)', '2004-07-19 06:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(816629, 91666, 17233, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here, though some may say too dark. Maybe just a fraction too much to the left and a little too far down with the composition but that''s just my opinion. Great perspective and appears sharp - well done (7)</td>', 'I like the lighting here, though some may say too dark. Maybe just a fraction too much to the left and a little too far down with the composition but that''s just my opinion. Great perspective and appears sharp - well done (7)', '2004-07-19 06:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(816632, 91797, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Two things that I would re-consider are the choice of frame and the positioning of the subject. The frame seems to be over-powering, too big and chunky and the subject could possibly be located down the bottom left third. I don''t think that the resulting negative space in the upper right would detract from the image. Overall very nice image though, well done (7)</td>', 'Great capture. Two things that I would re-consider are the choice of frame and the positioning of the subject. The frame seems to be over-powering, too big and chunky and the subject could possibly be located down the bottom left third. I don''t think that the resulting negative space in the upper right would detract from the image. Overall very nice image though, well done (7)', '2004-07-19 06:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(816633, 92120, 17233, '<td valign="top">What a talented little acrobat :). Nice composition and exposure. DOF is great - well done (8)</td>', 'What a talented little acrobat :). Nice composition and exposure. DOF is great - well done (8)', '2004-07-19 06:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(816634, 92133, 17233, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Vibrant colours, good DOF and reflection. One change I would consider would be to crop some of the right side out. There is very little positive detail there anyway and it would help improve the composition by effectively moving the subject to the upper right third. Well done (7)</td>', 'Nice image. Vibrant colours, good DOF and reflection. One change I would consider would be to crop some of the right side out. There is very little positive detail there anyway and it would help improve the composition by effectively moving the subject to the upper right third. Well done (7)', '2004-07-19 06:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(816635, 92052, 17233, '<td valign="top">Top image. Great colours, great DOF and great lighting. Awesome composition too - well done. I love it (10)</td>', 'Top image. Great colours, great DOF and great lighting. Awesome composition too - well done. I love it (10)', '2004-07-19 06:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(816636, 92176, 17233, '<td valign="top">Cool shot - I feel that I should be leaning somewhat to the left to stop sliding myself :) You have good composition and saturation and definately conveys balance. Well done (9)</td>', 'Cool shot - I feel that I should be leaning somewhat to the left to stop sliding myself :) You have good composition and saturation and definately conveys balance. Well done (9)', '2004-07-19 06:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(816637, 92055, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Whilst the lighting seems adequate, the square crop and the harsh line between foreground and background spoil the image a little. (6)</td>', 'Great idea. Whilst the lighting seems adequate, the square crop and the harsh line between foreground and background spoil the image a little. (6)', '2004-07-19 06:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(816641, 92126, 17233, '<td valign="top">Phew! Glad I didn''t have fish for dinner :). I like the composition here and the tonal balance is good. I''m just glad I can''t smell it. (7)</td>', 'Phew! Glad I didn''t have fish for dinner :). I like the composition here and the tonal balance is good. I''m just glad I can''t smell it. (7)', '2004-07-19 06:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(816642, 92137, 17233, '<td valign="top">Wow - like it! Awesome blue, love the silhouette and the sun flare behind it. The light plays on the clouds beautifully. Great composition too. Well done (10)</td>', 'Wow - like it! Awesome blue, love the silhouette and the sun flare behind it. The light plays on the clouds beautifully. Great composition too. Well done (10)', '2004-07-19 06:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(816644, 91366, 17233, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting and composition. The square crop really suits this image and I even like the frame. Great image, well done (10)</td>', 'Awesome lighting and composition. The square crop really suits this image and I even like the frame. Great image, well done (10)', '2004-07-19 06:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(816645, 91584, 17233, '<td valign="top">Awesome. The lighting on the egg may just be a little too harsh but that''s neither here nor there in this image. Centred composition suits and the image is sharp and clean. Well done (9)</td>', 'Awesome. The lighting on the egg may just be a little too harsh but that''s neither here nor there in this image. Centred composition suits and the image is sharp and clean. Well done (9)', '2004-07-19 06:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(816647, 91675, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and the subject is well placed within frame. Well done (8)</td>', 'Great lighting and the subject is well placed within frame. Well done (8)', '2004-07-19 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(816648, 92164, 17233, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective and I love the silhouette with that incredible sky. Burning adds a touch of drama to the sky as well. Great image (9)</td>', 'Awesome perspective and I love the silhouette with that incredible sky. Burning adds a touch of drama to the sky as well. Great image (9)', '2004-07-19 07:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(816649, 92157, 17233, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and contrast really make this image kick. Desaturation and symetrical composition work very well here. Well done (9)</td>', 'Great perspective and contrast really make this image kick. Desaturation and symetrical composition work very well here. Well done (9)', '2004-07-19 07:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(816658, 92176, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colours are very rich. The green and purple work well together. The composition is also well balanced.</td>', 'The colours are very rich. The green and purple work well together. The composition is also well balanced.', '2004-07-19 08:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(816659, 91906, 23300, '<td valign="top">The centred composition really works for me. The fountain does seem a little overexposed in that the water has no detail or shades to it.</td>', 'The centred composition really works for me. The fountain does seem a little overexposed in that the water has no detail or shades to it.', '2004-07-19 08:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(816660, 92207, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition. Good Lighting</td>', 'Nice Composition. Good Lighting', '2004-07-19 08:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(816661, 92076, 23300, '<td valign="top">The compostion works well and the silver ball really stands out in the context of the image. The lighting is really good too.</td>', 'The compostion works well and the silver ball really stands out in the context of the image. The lighting is really good too.', '2004-07-19 08:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(816662, 91585, 22580, '<td valign="top">Good job. See a bit of noise though.</td>', 'Good job. See a bit of noise though.', '2004-07-19 08:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(816663, 90794, 22580, '<td valign="top">Good shot!</td>', 'Good shot!', '2004-07-19 08:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(816665, 92180, 22580, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2004-07-19 08:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816666, 92126, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works well. I have to admit the subject matter makes the image a little difficult to appreciate. I think it would have worked really well as a black and white photo. This would enhance the textures and shapes.</td>', 'The composition works well. I have to admit the subject matter makes the image a little difficult to appreciate. I think it would have worked really well as a black and white photo. This would enhance the textures and shapes.', '2004-07-19 08:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(816667, 92007, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-07-19 08:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(816668, 91664, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The central composition works well. The coulours and lighting are rich. The stop-motion on the fountains creates a nice texture contrast to the building.</td>', 'Beautiful image. The central composition works well. The coulours and lighting are rich. The stop-motion on the fountains creates a nice texture contrast to the building.', '2004-07-19 08:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(816669, 91984, 22580, '<td valign="top">Hmm, title doesn''t make sense. Should it be "Seconds before it all collapsed"?</td>', 'Hmm, title doesn''t make sense. Should it be "Seconds before it all collapsed"?', '2004-07-19 08:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(816671, 91765, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the gothic look of this image. The depth of field works really well and the silhouette effect produces great impact.</td>', 'I really like the gothic look of this image. The depth of field works really well and the silhouette effect produces great impact.', '2004-07-19 08:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(816672, 92055, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great idea and executed brilliantly. The Black and white works really well. The centred composition is perfect.</td>', 'Great idea and executed brilliantly. The Black and white works really well. The centred composition is perfect.', '2004-07-19 08:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(816674, 91789, 20375, '<td valign="top">This is so simple. Pleasing to the eye! The composition is excellent..(rule of thirds).<br/>Exposure is good, focus good. Like I say..so simple and I love it!<br/></td>', 'This is so simple. Pleasing to the eye! The composition is excellent..(rule of thirds).Exposure is good, focus good. Like I say..so simple and I love it!', '2004-07-19 08:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(816675, 92210, 20375, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2004-07-19 08:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(816676, 92161, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the choice of black and white. The composition is interesting the way that the monument sits next to the tree. I would have rotated the image to get the monument exactly vertical. This is a very evocative image.</td>', 'I love the choice of black and white. The composition is interesting the way that the monument sits next to the tree. I would have rotated the image to get the monument exactly vertical. This is a very evocative image.', '2004-07-19 08:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(816678, 91872, 23300, '<td valign="top">Lovely Image. The composition is ideal. The border works well too. This echos a chemical molecule or "double helix" diagram. The lighting and colour work really well too.</td>', 'Lovely Image. The composition is ideal. The border works well too. This echos a chemical molecule or "double helix" diagram. The lighting and colour work really well too.', '2004-07-19 08:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(816679, 91789, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this works really well. The depth of field is perfect. The composition adds well to the sense of balance. I think a little bit of light on the small stone on the right would have helped also. I think it gets just a little bit dark on the right hand side. I really like the textures.</td>', 'I think this works really well. The depth of field is perfect. The composition adds well to the sense of balance. I think a little bit of light on the small stone on the right would have helped also. I think it gets just a little bit dark on the right hand side. I really like the textures.', '2004-07-19 08:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(816680, 92011, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colour and light are really striking. I personally would have gone for a little more space above the bird.</td>', 'The colour and light are really striking. I personally would have gone for a little more space above the bird.', '2004-07-19 08:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(816684, 91772, 23300, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Obviously a lot of thought and work in setting it up. The colours work well together. The focus does seem a little "soft" and it seems like the jpg compression may have been a bit heavy as there seem to be some "colour artifacts" around the subjects. Good idea though.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Obviously a lot of thought and work in setting it up. The colours work well together. The focus does seem a little "soft" and it seems like the jpg compression may have been a bit heavy as there seem to be some "colour artifacts" around the subjects. Good idea though.', '2004-07-19 08:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(816685, 92065, 16970, '<td valign="top">LOL...  Isn''t it funny to watch :)   (7)</td>', 'LOL...  Isn''t it funny to watch :)   (7)', '2004-07-19 08:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(816686, 91285, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the centred composition works well and the border too. The lighting is excellent and the depth of field works well. I also like the way the background is split between light and dark across the middle on the same plane as the large flat rock.</td>', 'I think the centred composition works well and the border too. The lighting is excellent and the depth of field works well. I also like the way the background is split between light and dark across the middle on the same plane as the large flat rock.', '2004-07-19 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(816688, 90886, 8005, '<td valign="top">That''s what I call balance!</td>', 'That''s what I call balance!', '2004-07-19 08:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(816689, 91549, 16970, '<td valign="top">Balance?</td>', 'Balance?', '2004-07-19 08:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(816691, 91803, 18450, '<td valign="top">Superb! Creative idea that is very well done.</td>', 'Superb! Creative idea that is very well done.', '2004-07-19 08:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(816692, 92225, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the colouring and lighting. I think they work really well, including the border. The texture of the wood works really well here too. The shadow across the top adds an effective contrast to the wood. The minimalist style of this image is quite appealing. I don''t know if the coin is strong enough by itself as a subject to offset the open spaces. I wonder if a lower angle to show more of the coin would make it a stronger contrast. Or a couple of coins lying down next to the one standing on its edge to provide another texture. This image does have a "feel" about it that really works.</td>', 'I really like the colouring and lighting. I think they work really well, including the border. The texture of the wood works really well here too. The shadow across the top adds an effective contrast to the wood. The minimalist style of this image is quite appealing. I don''t know if the coin is strong enough by itself as a subject to offset the open spaces. I wonder if a lower angle to show more of the coin would make it a stronger contrast. Or a couple of coins lying down next to the one standing on its edge to provide another texture. This image does have a "feel" about it that really works.', '2004-07-19 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(816693, 92175, 16970, '<td valign="top">I like it...  It could be alittle sharper but the softness suits the feel.  I can see what you were trying to achieve. (9)</td>', 'I like it...  It could be alittle sharper but the softness suits the feel.  I can see what you were trying to achieve. (9)', '2004-07-19 08:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
