(816877, 92076, 7628, '<td valign="top">A compelling subject that works with this challenge in multiple ways.  I wish the composition matched the subject better - perhaps face on, rather than the side and lighting to show the strength in both arms.  The flash is just too harsh and the background too random.</td>', 'A compelling subject that works with this challenge in multiple ways.  I wish the composition matched the subject better - perhaps face on, rather than the side and lighting to show the strength in both arms.  The flash is just too harsh and the background too random.', '2004-07-19 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(816880, 91675, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the black background.  I like how you''ve shifted the composition to the right, which actually balances it nicely in the frame (rather than center it).  I think softer lighting would match the mood better, but this lighting does illuminate the subject well, 7</td>', 'I like the subject and the black background.  I like how you''ve shifted the composition to the right, which actually balances it nicely in the frame (rather than center it).  I think softer lighting would match the mood better, but this lighting does illuminate the subject well, 7', '2004-07-19 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(816882, 92210, 7628, '<td valign="top">well lit, interestingly composed, but such an odd subject.  The treatment of the subject is so traditional, but the subject is so silly - ther is an imbalance between the two.  For technique I''d give you a 9 or 10 but for subject I just don''t know what to say. - 6?</td>', 'well lit, interestingly composed, but such an odd subject.  The treatment of the subject is so traditional, but the subject is so silly - ther is an imbalance between the two.  For technique I''d give you a 9 or 10 but for subject I just don''t know what to say. - 6?', '2004-07-19 13:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(816886, 91772, 7628, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, an interesting illusion. The lighting is not very illuminating, and the reflections are distracting.  If the lighting could help in the the illusion that the glass in suspended and perhaps be more dramatic, and the background should be flatter without crinkles and shadows.  Perhaps against black, and on a black table would issolate the subject better.</td>', 'Clever idea, an interesting illusion. The lighting is not very illuminating, and the reflections are distracting.  If the lighting could help in the the illusion that the glass in suspended and perhaps be more dramatic, and the background should be flatter without crinkles and shadows.  Perhaps against black, and on a black table would issolate the subject better.', '2004-07-19 13:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(816888, 91883, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fascinating action shot.  I like the flying bitsof wood, but they also make it hard to see the subject.  Perhaps instead of a flash, or in addition to the flas a strong light from the side?</td>', 'Fascinating action shot.  I like the flying bitsof wood, but they also make it hard to see the subject.  Perhaps instead of a flash, or in addition to the flas a strong light from the side?', '2004-07-19 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
