(816902, 91797, 23454, '<td valign="top">The frame is really overpowering this photo. A small simple border (or none at all) would have been much better. The photo meets the challenge well...could have been a tad more focused. The colors and lighting are very nice.</td>', 'The frame is really overpowering this photo. A small simple border (or none at all) would have been much better. The photo meets the challenge well...could have been a tad more focused. The colors and lighting are very nice.', '2004-07-19 13:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(816904, 91772, 23454, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. The reflections in the shaker are distracting, but hard to avoid, I know. THe only other suggestion I have for improvement would have been to shoot on a different table that wouldn''t have caused the rounded shadow at the bottom of the picture. An additional soft light source might have fixed those shadows too.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. The reflections in the shaker are distracting, but hard to avoid, I know. THe only other suggestion I have for improvement would have been to shoot on a different table that wouldn''t have caused the rounded shadow at the bottom of the picture. An additional soft light source might have fixed those shadows too.', '2004-07-19 13:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(816907, 91783, 23454, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. Meets the challenge well. I like the color choices you made here. The focus and lighting are great. I can''t see anything that I would change!</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. Meets the challenge well. I like the color choices you made here. The focus and lighting are great. I can''t see anything that I would change!', '2004-07-19 13:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
