(817372, 92011, 21362, '<td valign="top">If I was being really picky I''d say I wish there was more detail in the feathers. It''s really hard to photograph such a light color but maybe a different time of day would have improved the light a bit. Regardless it''s a beautiful pic and a great example of balance.  (Why DO they stand like that?)  I like the backdrop of purple flowers. It''s in my top ten for sure. Good job!</td>', 'If I was being really picky I''d say I wish there was more detail in the feathers. It''s really hard to photograph such a light color but maybe a different time of day would have improved the light a bit. Regardless it''s a beautiful pic and a great example of balance.  (Why DO they stand like that?)  I like the backdrop of purple flowers. It''s in my top ten for sure. Good job!', '2004-07-19 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
