(817631, 92011, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts of colors and shapes. I like how you chose to emphasize the subject here and filled up most of the frame with the flamingo. The detail and focus is excellent as well.</td>', 'Great contrasts of colors and shapes. I like how you chose to emphasize the subject here and filled up most of the frame with the flamingo. The detail and focus is excellent as well.', '2004-07-20 00:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
