(817638, 92211, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good idea and execution. The title works well here to deliver your point. Personally, I would have liked this shot with more "dimension" to it. Maybe shot from an angle instead of directly above.</td>', 'Good idea and execution. The title works well here to deliver your point. Personally, I would have liked this shot with more "dimension" to it. Maybe shot from an angle instead of directly above.', '2004-07-20 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
