(817641, 91366, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great work really well done, my guess is that its not a full egg sitting up like that but I could be wrong. That is why this is so good  a shot it asks plenty of questions and gets the viewer  to really examine it.</td>', 'Great work really well done, my guess is that its not a full egg sitting up like that but I could be wrong. That is why this is so good  a shot it asks plenty of questions and gets the viewer  to really examine it.', '2004-07-20 00:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
