(817649, 92074, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The composition on this one really draws the eye across the photo. The B&amp;W works well here too.</td>', 'Great shot. The composition on this one really draws the eye across the photo. The B&W works well here too.', '2004-07-20 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(817651, 91953, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the color palette and tones in the shot. The subject is very whimsical too and is also nice and subtle behind the glass. The only thing I found distracting was the photographer reflection.</td>', 'I like the color palette and tones in the shot. The subject is very whimsical too and is also nice and subtle behind the glass. The only thing I found distracting was the photographer reflection.', '2004-07-20 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(817655, 91765, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color desaturation and sillouhettes here. It makes a very common scene much more emotive and interesting. I would have liked to see a tighter crop to frame more of the crow. But nice shot regardless.</td>', 'Nice use of color desaturation and sillouhettes here. It makes a very common scene much more emotive and interesting. I would have liked to see a tighter crop to frame more of the crow. But nice shot regardless.', '2004-07-20 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(817658, 92167, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very good capture. Wonderful composition and DOF. Personally, I would have liked to see more of the cyclist in the framing. Maybe a lower POV to emphasize scale and a tighter zoom? Colors also seem a little imbalanced on my monitor. Too much red saturation? Anyways, great work .... 7</td>', 'Very good capture. Wonderful composition and DOF. Personally, I would have liked to see more of the cyclist in the framing. Maybe a lower POV to emphasize scale and a tighter zoom? Colors also seem a little imbalanced on my monitor. Too much red saturation? Anyways, great work .... 7', '2004-07-20 00:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(817661, 91222, 20235, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty capture. Your subject and zen theme are very indicative of balance. The subtle color palette and tones work very well here. As does the border you created. I give an 8</td>', 'VERY pretty capture. Your subject and zen theme are very indicative of balance. The subtle color palette and tones work very well here. As does the border you created. I give an 8', '2004-07-20 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(817666, 92083, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great concept and execution. I like this photo for its ability to illustrate balance on different levels...<br/>1) Your subject implies balance <br/>2) Your composition and framing is perfectly balanced<br/>The only thing I found distracting is the reflection from a watch/ bracelet? on your subject. Very insignificant point though, and great shot nonetheless</td>', 'Great concept and execution. I like this photo for its ability to illustrate balance on different levels...1) Your subject implies balance 2) Your composition and framing is perfectly balancedThe only thing I found distracting is the reflection from a watch/ bracelet? on your subject. Very insignificant point though, and great shot nonetheless', '2004-07-20 00:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(817668, 92018, 20235, '<td valign="top">Amazing focus and detail. Although at first I thought it lacked any real focal point or subject, I still find it very interesting to look at. Nice work.</td>', 'Amazing focus and detail. Although at first I thought it lacked any real focal point or subject, I still find it very interesting to look at. Nice work.', '2004-07-20 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(817669, 92157, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow, where do I start! Beautiful balance in composition and framing. The shapes, lines, and textures you managed to capture are fantastic. Great cropping and POV used, with absolutely no lens distortion (that I can see). The muted colors and dark sky provide a great contrast. And the title is fantastic. In a nutshell..... I give a 9</td>', 'Wow, where do I start! Beautiful balance in composition and framing. The shapes, lines, and textures you managed to capture are fantastic. Great cropping and POV used, with absolutely no lens distortion (that I can see). The muted colors and dark sky provide a great contrast. And the title is fantastic. In a nutshell..... I give a 9', '2004-07-20 00:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(817672, 92067, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wonderful POV and framing in this shot. The sillouhette and backlighting work very well. A couple elements I found distracting were the powerlines in the background (easy to remove via cloning in Pshop). And the color also appears off-balance (no pun intended). Color saturation appears more heavily weighted in the green/emerald spectrum on my monitor. Nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Wonderful POV and framing in this shot. The sillouhette and backlighting work very well. A couple elements I found distracting were the powerlines in the background (easy to remove via cloning in Pshop). And the color also appears off-balance (no pun intended). Color saturation appears more heavily weighted in the green/emerald spectrum on my monitor. Nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-20 00:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(817674, 92055, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like your composition and subject here. The only thing I would have liked to see different is the use of color. I don''t think the B&amp;W really adds to the feel of the shot in this case. But that''s just my personal taste, and its a great capture nonetheless..... I give a 9</td>', 'Great photo. I like your composition and subject here. The only thing I would have liked to see different is the use of color. I don''t think the B&W really adds to the feel of the shot in this case. But that''s just my personal taste, and its a great capture nonetheless..... I give a 9', '2004-07-20 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(817677, 91581, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is so awesome...fantastic shot that has a great car, great legs and just an overall cool feel.  10</td>', 'That is so awesome...fantastic shot that has a great car, great legs and just an overall cool feel.  10', '2004-07-20 00:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(817692, 92210, 10818, '<td valign="top">I dont normally vote little toys high...but i really like this one...very well done.</td>', 'I dont normally vote little toys high...but i really like this one...very well done.', '2004-07-20 00:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(817701, 92018, 15920, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I looked twice, but can''t understand the relationship to the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, I looked twice, but can''t understand the relationship to the challenge.', '2004-07-20 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(817712, 91581, 19025, '<td valign="top">Balancing 2 women? I''m assuming that this is what you meant...  Funny picture though.</td>', 'Balancing 2 women? I''m assuming that this is what you meant...  Funny picture though.', '2004-07-20 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(817716, 91976, 23279, '<td valign="top">Great photo!!  (9)</td>', 'Great photo!!  (9)', '2004-07-20 01:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(817717, 90794, 19025, '<td valign="top">You can really feel the motion on the road here. I  really like  this picture.  8</td>', 'You can really feel the motion on the road here. I  really like  this picture.  8', '2004-07-20 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(817718, 92108, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed with fantastic colors. I''m really fond of the warm color palette used.</td>', 'Beautifully composed with fantastic colors. I''m really fond of the warm color palette used.', '2004-07-20 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(817720, 91281, 19025, '<td valign="top">I understand that they are all dancing and and all..but would have liked to see it a little more still.  I wouldn''t be suprised if alot of other ppl said the same thing. Goodluck!</td>', 'I understand that they are all dancing and and all..but would have liked to see it a little more still.  I wouldn''t be suprised if alot of other ppl said the same thing. Goodluck!', '2004-07-20 01:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(817721, 91686, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The mixture of darkness and light works very well to create and almost "storybook" appearance.</td>', 'Nice capture. The mixture of darkness and light works very well to create and almost "storybook" appearance.', '2004-07-20 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(817723, 92075, 19025, '<td valign="top">Balancing time?</td>', 'Balancing time?', '2004-07-20 01:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(817725, 91366, 19025, '<td valign="top">This is humorus and great lighting.  I can''t believe you think this photo would be DQ''d. I think it''s a good idea of balance.</td>', 'This is humorus and great lighting.  I can''t believe you think this photo would be DQ''d. I think it''s a good idea of balance.', '2004-07-20 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(817727, 92165, 24229, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the lighting &amp; composition make it look like a dramatic balancing act :)</td>', 'Nice shot, the lighting & composition make it look like a dramatic balancing act :)', '2004-07-20 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(817733, 92033, 20235, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I hope that most of the voters "get it" in relation to your title.  Besides the inherent difficulty of capturing lighting, you''ve managed to get some great composition and framing of the event.  The sillouhette of the house and tree, along with the subtle coloration totally make the shot...... 9</td>', 'This is a great shot. I hope that most of the voters "get it" in relation to your title.  Besides the inherent difficulty of capturing lighting, you''ve managed to get some great composition and framing of the event.  The sillouhette of the house and tree, along with the subtle coloration totally make the shot...... 9', '2004-07-20 01:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(817734, 92033, 24076, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but I think it''s a stretch to cast it in the Balance challenge.</td>', 'This is a great shot but I think it''s a stretch to cast it in the Balance challenge.', '2004-07-20 01:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(817744, 91988, 24076, '<td valign="top">this would have been perfect if the equipment had been clean. Those smudges of (I''m afraid to ask) are very distracting.</td>', 'this would have been perfect if the equipment had been clean. Those smudges of (I''m afraid to ask) are very distracting.', '2004-07-20 01:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(817747, 92075, 24076, '<td valign="top">It''s 11:14 a.m.<br/> <br/>Nice pic, though</td>', 'It''s 11:14 a.m. Nice pic, though', '2004-07-20 01:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(817749, 91783, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition!<br/>Detail &amp; clarity are first-rate, and one of my favorites in this challenge! ((10))</td>', 'Stunning composition!Detail & clarity are first-rate, and one of my favorites in this challenge! ((10))', '2004-07-20 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(817752, 91583, 24076, '<td valign="top">hmmmmm, too bad that door inset is there to spoil the backdrop.</td>', 'hmmmmm, too bad that door inset is there to spoil the backdrop.', '2004-07-20 01:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(817753, 91953, 24076, '<td valign="top">The whole concept of the photo is wonderful. Some tips: opening the door and zooming in on JUST the two signs would have been sublime; if you couldn''t zoom in, at least open the door; if you can''t open the door, make sure your reflection isn''t captured.</td>', 'The whole concept of the photo is wonderful. Some tips: opening the door and zooming in on JUST the two signs would have been sublime; if you couldn''t zoom in, at least open the door; if you can''t open the door, make sure your reflection isn''t captured.', '2004-07-20 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(817754, 91097, 24076, '<td valign="top">Was there no way to get the title of the ball absolutely horizontal?</td>', 'Was there no way to get the title of the ball absolutely horizontal?', '2004-07-20 01:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(817773, 90794, 22459, '<td valign="top">This must of been hard !!. Well done great image.</td>', 'This must of been hard !!. Well done great image.', '2004-07-20 03:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(817791, 91985, 17233, '<td valign="top">Ah, the balance of work and family. A hard act to perform these days. I like your composition and lighting (natural) and the expression on the boys face says it all. Well done (9)</td>', 'Ah, the balance of work and family. A hard act to perform these days. I like your composition and lighting (natural) and the expression on the boys face says it all. Well done (9)', '2004-07-20 03:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(817795, 91783, 17233, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot. The marvels of engineering eh! The sepia (?) tones work for this image IMO as it lets the lines of the subject to be viewed without the distraction of colour. Well done (9)</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. The marvels of engineering eh! The sepia (?) tones work for this image IMO as it lets the lines of the subject to be viewed without the distraction of colour. Well done (9)', '2004-07-20 04:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(817796, 92165, 17233, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and I like the lighting and DOF as both separate the subject from the backgound well, and yet show enough detail of the background to distinguish it. Well done (8)</td>', 'Nice perspective and I like the lighting and DOF as both separate the subject from the backgound well, and yet show enough detail of the background to distinguish it. Well done (8)', '2004-07-20 04:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(817801, 92216, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is a NICE picture.</td>', 'This is a NICE picture.', '2004-07-20 04:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(817804, 91666, 23579, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. I like the way you made the lighting and made the background dark, but that''s just my opinnion. You even made each row with the same cards! Did it take you longer to get the cards to stand than take the picture?</td>', 'Cool picture. I like the way you made the lighting and made the background dark, but that''s just my opinnion. You even made each row with the same cards! Did it take you longer to get the cards to stand than take the picture?', '2004-07-20 04:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(817805, 91237, 15511, '<td valign="top">Contrast? This image is lacking some.</td>', 'Contrast? This image is lacking some.', '2004-07-20 04:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(817808, 90794, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, it works well.  Might be over sharpened a little, as I think that may be what has caused the halo around the handlebars, which I do not like, but overall still a great shot.</td>', 'Clever idea, it works well.  Might be over sharpened a little, as I think that may be what has caused the halo around the handlebars, which I do not like, but overall still a great shot.', '2004-07-20 04:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(817809, 91746, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simple and very effective.</td>', 'Simple and very effective.', '2004-07-20 04:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(817811, 91366, 10170, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is sensational.</td>', 'The lighting here is sensational.', '2004-07-20 04:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(817812, 92220, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.', '2004-07-20 04:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(817813, 91797, 10170, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but not the frame, as I find that has overwhelmed the actual image.</td>', 'I like the photo, but not the frame, as I find that has overwhelmed the actual image.', '2004-07-20 04:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(817815, 92170, 10170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it.</td>', 'Absolutely love it.', '2004-07-20 04:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(817819, 91281, 16046, '<td valign="top">I like the motion, the top 2 dancers look like tropical storms, great color, 9</td>', 'I like the motion, the top 2 dancers look like tropical storms, great color, 9', '2004-07-20 04:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(817821, 91802, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great sky, good work.</td>', 'Great sky, good work.', '2004-07-20 04:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(817822, 91675, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.', '2004-07-20 04:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
