(817848, 91803, 22459, '<td valign="top">good image showing balance but the cloak distracts me a little, I don''t know if you intended but it looks a bit like a crumpled bed sheet. still scored it high though</td>', 'good image showing balance but the cloak distracts me a little, I don''t know if you intended but it looks a bit like a crumpled bed sheet. still scored it high though', '2004-07-20 05:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
