(818141, 92052, 14603, '<td valign="top">A flower picture with a difference !<br/>Nicely set up..good lighting and composition and the one flower lying on it`s side is the finishing touch which adds that little bit more to the image.<br/>Superb.</td>', 'A flower picture with a difference !Nicely set up..good lighting and composition and the one flower lying on it`s side is the finishing touch which adds that little bit more to the image.Superb.', '2004-07-20 13:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(818148, 92026, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught..the pose looks as if it`s right at the maximum point of balance ..just before release. The blurring gives a nice feeling of movement to the picture.<br/>If the background had been pinsharp this would have been a ten from me but love it all the same....8</td>', 'Nicely caught..the pose looks as if it`s right at the maximum point of balance ..just before release. The blurring gives a nice feeling of movement to the picture.If the background had been pinsharp this would have been a ten from me but love it all the same....8', '2004-07-20 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(818154, 91987, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image....looks almost like a screen set and could imagine it as a poster for a forthcoming film.<br/>The "dodge and burn" style is familiar and I have a wee idea where this was "produced".<br/>Can`t wait to see if I`m right.  :)<br/>Excellent work...sure to do well.<br/></td>', 'Very powerful image....looks almost like a screen set and could imagine it as a poster for a forthcoming film.The "dodge and burn" style is familiar and I have a wee idea where this was "produced".Can`t wait to see if I`m right.  :)Excellent work...sure to do well.', '2004-07-20 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(818156, 92226, 16106, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a bit more foreground instead of the cairn shooting into the frame. Other than that, nice focus and colors, interesting composition, well framed by thirds.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a bit more foreground instead of the cairn shooting into the frame. Other than that, nice focus and colors, interesting composition, well framed by thirds.', '2004-07-20 13:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(818159, 91452, 16106, '<td valign="top">Since this is an advanced editing challenge, you could have brightened this up and still kept the brooding sky colors.  othere than the darkness I love this shot, seems deeply odd but quite at ease, good focal depth and i like the centered composition.</td>', 'Since this is an advanced editing challenge, you could have brightened this up and still kept the brooding sky colors.  othere than the darkness I love this shot, seems deeply odd but quite at ease, good focal depth and i like the centered composition.', '2004-07-20 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(818163, 91973, 14603, '<td valign="top">I`m not fond of pictures which use toys as props...there`s no real indication of balance in the image..just hinted at in the title....So why do I think this is really good ??<br/>The mix of blue, pink and green in the blurred background is pleasantly complimentary. The head of the "flamingo" with the little highlight above the eye is nicely crisp and sharp in contrast to the background and placed to perfection.<br/>Overall..great image...hope it does well.</td>', 'I`m not fond of pictures which use toys as props...there`s no real indication of balance in the image..just hinted at in the title....So why do I think this is really good ??The mix of blue, pink and green in the blurred background is pleasantly complimentary. The head of the "flamingo" with the little highlight above the eye is nicely crisp and sharp in contrast to the background and placed to perfection.Overall..great image...hope it does well.', '2004-07-20 13:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(818165, 92074, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and the grainy feel really adds to the image for me.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Good composition and the grainy feel really adds to the image for me.Nice work.', '2004-07-20 13:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(818169, 91033, 16106, '<td valign="top">the winner. Nice job, all the details nailed down. i like the level of complexity, had you not used the symbolic backround, or the detailed base, the shot would have been well done, good touch of reflected color, tight focus, and nice, but the added levels which harmonize with the main subject make this my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'the winner. Nice job, all the details nailed down. i like the level of complexity, had you not used the symbolic backround, or the detailed base, the shot would have been well done, good touch of reflected color, tight focus, and nice, but the added levels which harmonize with the main subject make this my favorite of the challenge.', '2004-07-20 13:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(818170, 92019, 11895, '<td valign="top">good idea, more depth of field would have earned a higher score from me</td>', 'good idea, more depth of field would have earned a higher score from me', '2004-07-20 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(818171, 91666, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good angle of shot and nice subdued light really add impact to the image<br/>Nice work..</td>', 'Good angle of shot and nice subdued light really add impact to the imageNice work..', '2004-07-20 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(818176, 91987, 16106, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, and great work with the dodge stick on this, I am in awe of what you got out of this difficult lighting situation. I would have never thought you could get anything at all from this lighting, let alone anything this special. Thanks for showing me that I was wrong. Rich details everywhere ( except ther dress, but at least you got it white) This one should be the best of the album.</td>', 'Fun shot, and great work with the dodge stick on this, I am in awe of what you got out of this difficult lighting situation. I would have never thought you could get anything at all from this lighting, let alone anything this special. Thanks for showing me that I was wrong. Rich details everywhere ( except ther dress, but at least you got it white) This one should be the best of the album.', '2004-07-20 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(818180, 91366, 16106, '<td valign="top">Could have done equally well in the Freedom challenge. Gereat lighting, fine use of subtle colors and an eggcentric but well balanced composition. not wild about the border, but that is a personal taste issue. Should be near ribbon land.</td>', 'Could have done equally well in the Freedom challenge. Gereat lighting, fine use of subtle colors and an eggcentric but well balanced composition. not wild about the border, but that is a personal taste issue. Should be near ribbon land.', '2004-07-20 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(818184, 92157, 16106, '<td valign="top">Prefect framaing was needed to pull off this shot and you nailed it. Strong conversion, and rich details. The title is one of the best this week.</td>', 'Prefect framaing was needed to pull off this shot and you nailed it. Strong conversion, and rich details. The title is one of the best this week.', '2004-07-20 13:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818189, 91973, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very funny shot, beautiful colors,and DOF. This is one of the few shots this week that both answers the challenge and would not need an explanation if you hung it on your wall. top ten</td>', 'Very funny shot, beautiful colors,and DOF. This is one of the few shots this week that both answers the challenge and would not need an explanation if you hung it on your wall. top ten', '2004-07-20 13:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(818197, 91666, 16106, '<td valign="top">This was an idea that I''m sure alot of people thought of, and when they saw this shot they either regretted using the idea or were glad they used another. Strong lighting, I like the level of detail in the setup with the different face cards on different levels, the framing was well done with the bottom being squeezed but a bit of room at the top. The use of a triangular void in the upper right used to balance out the triangular figure is a nice touch. I usually like to point out one flaw when giving praise, but I can find none.</td>', 'This was an idea that I''m sure alot of people thought of, and when they saw this shot they either regretted using the idea or were glad they used another. Strong lighting, I like the level of detail in the setup with the different face cards on different levels, the framing was well done with the bottom being squeezed but a bit of room at the top. The use of a triangular void in the upper right used to balance out the triangular figure is a nice touch. I usually like to point out one flaw when giving praise, but I can find none.', '2004-07-20 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(818203, 92165, 16106, '<td valign="top">The face dimly lit in the backround takes this shot from good/compotent to top flight. The only knock is that the hand is a bit too hot for something that close to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'The face dimly lit in the backround takes this shot from good/compotent to top flight. The only knock is that the hand is a bit too hot for something that close to the edge of the frame.', '2004-07-20 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
