(818377, 91747, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow!! What a fantastic photo. Fit with theme is outstanding. Very dynamic composition. Focus and clarity of the sails is terrific. Depth cueing with the haze adds to the sense of distance. Top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Wow!! What a fantastic photo. Fit with theme is outstanding. Very dynamic composition. Focus and clarity of the sails is terrific. Depth cueing with the haze adds to the sense of distance. Top 10 for sure.', '2004-07-20 17:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
