(818475, 91581, 9763, '<td valign="top">Is that James from Metallica?<br/>I like the colors a lot.  The feet are cut off though, which is distracting a bit.  The crop is too tight above his head too.  The blue sticker in the window is a bit distracting too.  the photo is unique, interesting and creative.  Great job!</td>', 'Is that James from Metallica?I like the colors a lot.  The feet are cut off though, which is distracting a bit.  The crop is too tight above his head too.  The blue sticker in the window is a bit distracting too.  the photo is unique, interesting and creative.  Great job!', '2004-07-20 18:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(818493, 91803, 22310, '<td valign="top">might have looked better if the wine did not blend into the background.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'might have looked better if the wine did not blend into the background.  Nice shot though.', '2004-07-20 18:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(818497, 92181, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little busy.  Maybe a narrower depth of field next time.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little busy.  Maybe a narrower depth of field next time.', '2004-07-20 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
