(818504, 92170, 14620, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful  and wonderful clarity.  I especially like the color tones you chose for this photo and the DOF, to me, seems spot on.  Very nice work.  One of my favorites of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Just bumped to a 9 :-)</td>', 'Simple, beautiful  and wonderful clarity.  I especially like the color tones you chose for this photo and the DOF, to me, seems spot on.  Very nice work.  One of my favorites of the challenge. Just bumped to a 9 :-)', '2004-07-20 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(818513, 91746, 19177, '<td valign="top">Great representation of balance. When I first looked at the photot, I thought it was a water splash. Great job!</td>', 'Great representation of balance. When I first looked at the photot, I thought it was a water splash. Great job!', '2004-07-20 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(818514, 92157, 19177, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, Beautiful Building... I love the color you used.</td>', 'Nice photo, Beautiful Building... I love the color you used.', '2004-07-20 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(818541, 92106, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty capture. Your use of sephia color and shallow DOF through the window, combined with the elegance of your subject create an almost etherial quality to the photo. I like how balance is not only illustrated by the subject alone, but also implied by the contrast between the curving lines of the ballerina and the straight lines on the window. Nice work .... 8</td>', 'Very pretty capture. Your use of sephia color and shallow DOF through the window, combined with the elegance of your subject create an almost etherial quality to the photo. I like how balance is not only illustrated by the subject alone, but also implied by the contrast between the curving lines of the ballerina and the straight lines on the window. Nice work .... 8', '2004-07-20 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(818545, 91910, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of composition and framing here. The way the subject fills the frame is great. One thing I''m not crazy about is the cropped out background. It seems to give it a somewhat "cut &amp; paste" feel. If the original background was distracting to the photo, maybe a really shallow DOF and/or selective levels adjustment to brighten it would have had a positive effect. If you''re working in Pshop, then maybe this photo would be a prime candidate for using a radial blur in the background.</td>', 'I like your choice of composition and framing here. The way the subject fills the frame is great. One thing I''m not crazy about is the cropped out background. It seems to give it a somewhat "cut & paste" feel. If the original background was distracting to the photo, maybe a really shallow DOF and/or selective levels adjustment to brighten it would have had a positive effect. If you''re working in Pshop, then maybe this photo would be a prime candidate for using a radial blur in the background.', '2004-07-20 19:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(818559, 92084, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the top of the banana is cut off, looks unnaturual. Perfect setup, nice lighting/background.  Lovely idea, should do well.</td>', 'I don''t like that the top of the banana is cut off, looks unnaturual. Perfect setup, nice lighting/background.  Lovely idea, should do well.', '2004-07-20 19:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
