(820418, 92170, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. When I look at the thumbnail, it looks like a dinosaur raising up out of a field of grass. I expected to hate it when I opened it up. What an O''Henry like surprise to open the image and see this stunning b&amp;w macro of a leaf balanced on it''s stem. I liked it a lot.  Technically, it''s a virtually perfect image. With the surprise ending, it''s one of the best in class. Top 10 for sure. Good job!</td>', 'I like this a lot. When I look at the thumbnail, it looks like a dinosaur raising up out of a field of grass. I expected to hate it when I opened it up. What an O''Henry like surprise to open the image and see this stunning b&w macro of a leaf balanced on it''s stem. I liked it a lot.  Technically, it''s a virtually perfect image. With the surprise ending, it''s one of the best in class. Top 10 for sure. Good job!', '2004-07-21 15:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(820517, 91789, 21714, '<td valign="top">There''s a really nice flow to this image. Love the tone and composition. Well done.</td>', 'There''s a really nice flow to this image. Love the tone and composition. Well done.', '2004-07-21 16:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(820519, 91225, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting.  great choice for b/w.  lost a point for the tilted horizon.</td>', 'nice composition and lighting.  great choice for b/w.  lost a point for the tilted horizon.', '2004-07-21 16:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(820520, 92164, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is brillaint. Well done.</td>', 'This is brillaint. Well done.', '2004-07-21 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(820521, 92209, 18485, '<td valign="top">richly detail and beautifully composed.</td>', 'richly detail and beautifully composed.', '2004-07-21 16:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(820522, 92011, 18485, '<td valign="top">great choice and nicely executed photograph.  top marks</td>', 'great choice and nicely executed photograph.  top marks', '2004-07-21 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(820534, 91225, 21714, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  I am not sure if you really need the bottom part of the image (is it a beach?)<br/>This is well thought out and nicely done. I will score this really. If it was my own image, I would increase the contrast a bit - just a personal choice that is)</td>', 'Really cool.  I am not sure if you really need the bottom part of the image (is it a beach?)This is well thought out and nicely done. I will score this really. If it was my own image, I would increase the contrast a bit - just a personal choice that is)', '2004-07-21 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(820543, 92055, 21714, '<td valign="top">Been is Ireland for 5 yrs now and haven''t seen that yet. I love your idea. Foreground is perfect for me but I do have a few issues with the background.  I think a complete washed out white background would make this image a classic. What I am trying to say is that the background is a bit distracting. I think a retake with a different background would be worthwhile. Bottom line is it''s a great image and I love it.</td>', 'Been is Ireland for 5 yrs now and haven''t seen that yet. I love your idea. Foreground is perfect for me but I do have a few issues with the background.  I think a complete washed out white background would make this image a classic. What I am trying to say is that the background is a bit distracting. I think a retake with a different background would be worthwhile. Bottom line is it''s a great image and I love it.', '2004-07-21 16:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(820555, 91877, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is a brillaint image but I think the post-processing has ruined it. I don''t know if you were trying to get details from areas where it didn''t exist or you went a little overboard.  If not for the post-processing flaws, I would have given it at least a 9. To me this is photography as  a form of art. The whole image has a nice flow and balance to it and it''s beautiful. Pity that an image like  this  has halos and all.</td>', 'This is a brillaint image but I think the post-processing has ruined it. I don''t know if you were trying to get details from areas where it didn''t exist or you went a little overboard.  If not for the post-processing flaws, I would have given it at least a 9. To me this is photography as  a form of art. The whole image has a nice flow and balance to it and it''s beautiful. Pity that an image like  this  has halos and all.', '2004-07-21 16:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(820564, 90988, 21714, '<td valign="top">I would have given this at least a 9 if the image wasn''t over-processed. There''s a halo around everything in the foreground. Yes, sharpening makes things stand out in images, but this is a case of abusing a tool. I really like the composition and I wish you hadn''t gone that far with the tools.</td>', 'I would have given this at least a 9 if the image wasn''t over-processed. There''s a halo around everything in the foreground. Yes, sharpening makes things stand out in images, but this is a case of abusing a tool. I really like the composition and I wish you hadn''t gone that far with the tools.', '2004-07-21 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(820569, 92106, 21714, '<td valign="top">Ballerina = Balance. But not in this image. I don''t think that the composition has really captured it. Her other leg in the image would have done better justice to this image.</td>', 'Ballerina = Balance. But not in this image. I don''t think that the composition has really captured it. Her other leg in the image would have done better justice to this image.', '2004-07-21 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(820595, 90674, 21714, '<td valign="top">This image is not a flaw in the DPC code is it? I think I have seen it done a few times before on DPC. I am not going to vote this image down because I have seen similar images before. What you have achieved is beautiful except for the top part of the image and colours on the sheets. Learning is about making an attempt. Best of luck.</td>', 'This image is not a flaw in the DPC code is it? I think I have seen it done a few times before on DPC. I am not going to vote this image down because I have seen similar images before. What you have achieved is beautiful except for the top part of the image and colours on the sheets. Learning is about making an attempt. Best of luck.', '2004-07-21 16:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(820607, 92210, 21714, '<td valign="top">I would call this happiness. Wondering why we don''t see humans like this often. Because we  aren''t made of rubber or plastic?  Anyway, this is supposed to be a comment. I love this image.</td>', 'I would call this happiness. Wondering why we don''t see humans like this often. Because we  aren''t made of rubber or plastic?  Anyway, this is supposed to be a comment. I love this image.', '2004-07-21 16:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(820632, 92059, 21714, '<td valign="top">Birdieeee looks like birdieee is forced into some background birdiee doesn''t know about. Point is, know when to stop fooling around with digital tools.  The very essence of your energy and time is destroyed by using a few tools in an image editing software.  That''s not creativity. That''s more like  the very opposite. Your idea was brilliant and your timing was pefect. It was the post-processing that destroyed it. Go easy on the tools.  A good shot is a great start. You are only editing it because you want it to loook better.</td>', 'Birdieeee looks like birdieee is forced into some background birdiee doesn''t know about. Point is, know when to stop fooling around with digital tools.  The very essence of your energy and time is destroyed by using a few tools in an image editing software.  That''s not creativity. That''s more like  the very opposite. Your idea was brilliant and your timing was pefect. It was the post-processing that destroyed it. Go easy on the tools.  A good shot is a great start. You are only editing it because you want it to loook better.', '2004-07-21 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(820662, 92084, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nutrional Balance?? (I think you missed some letters). Well, I am not going to score you low for a typo.  To me even if the title says -*/)9*7^5$$$, It''s the image that I am intererested in. Your idea is good and you have done a good bit of work on it. But it doesn''t really grab my attention. I am not writing this because I am going to give you a really low score.<br/>You have actually done something instead of finding the easy way out. But, to me the image doesn''t really show Nutritional Balance.  It''s more like fruits balancing. I think when you come up with titles like that (without the typos) it has to convey a message.  And I don''t think this image does.  Best of luck and I do hope that you will keep on pushing.</td>', 'Nutrional Balance?? (I think you missed some letters). Well, I am not going to score you low for a typo.  To me even if the title says -*/)9*7^5$$$, It''s the image that I am intererested in. Your idea is good and you have done a good bit of work on it. But it doesn''t really grab my attention. I am not writing this because I am going to give you a really low score.You have actually done something instead of finding the easy way out. But, to me the image doesn''t really show Nutritional Balance.  It''s more like fruits balancing. I think when you come up with titles like that (without the typos) it has to convey a message.  And I don''t think this image does.  Best of luck and I do hope that you will keep on pushing.', '2004-07-21 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(820728, 92216, 23577, '<td valign="top">Great Exposure and color saturation!</td>', 'Great Exposure and color saturation!', '2004-07-21 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(820769, 91973, 3087, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this picture, it makes me giggle everytime I see it... but the link to the challenge is LAME! Plastic flamingoes! ! It''s just soooo camp! Very cool! Ha ha ha! Nice composition, love the eye contact, great use of shallow DOF. Ha ha ha ha. Pink plastic flamingoes... whoduhvthunkit?</td>', 'I LOVE this picture, it makes me giggle everytime I see it... but the link to the challenge is LAME! Plastic flamingoes! ! It''s just soooo camp! Very cool! Ha ha ha! Nice composition, love the eye contact, great use of shallow DOF. Ha ha ha ha. Pink plastic flamingoes... whoduhvthunkit?', '2004-07-21 18:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(820772, 91987, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very striking - the curve of the decking and then the straight line of the water and the rich cloud detail and the texture and of course the fun pose and then the wonderful OTT high contrast treatment. I think this is superb!</td>', 'Wow! Very striking - the curve of the decking and then the straight line of the water and the rich cloud detail and the texture and of course the fun pose and then the wonderful OTT high contrast treatment. I think this is superb!', '2004-07-21 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(820775, 92170, 3087, '<td valign="top">How clever! Works well in B/W and the composition feels just right.</td>', 'How clever! Works well in B/W and the composition feels just right.', '2004-07-21 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(820781, 92037, 20472, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective</td>', 'Excellent perspective', '2004-07-21 18:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
