(821239, 91033, 18197, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this, it didn''t do much for me. But the more I see it the more impressed I am with the image. The subtlties of the background and the table top are intriguing. It is obviously a superb example of balance. Reflections are good. Where''s the camera? Depth of field is wonderful. Great job. Among my top picks (upon reflection).</td>', 'When I first saw this, it didn''t do much for me. But the more I see it the more impressed I am with the image. The subtlties of the background and the table top are intriguing. It is obviously a superb example of balance. Reflections are good. Where''s the camera? Depth of field is wonderful. Great job. Among my top picks (upon reflection).', '2004-07-22 00:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(821240, 91789, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the zen like image of balance with its zen like simplicity. Among my top picks for technical excellence and composition. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the zen like image of balance with its zen like simplicity. Among my top picks for technical excellence and composition. Good luck.', '2004-07-22 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(821248, 92126, 18197, '<td valign="top">A visceral image. Photography should  be emotive, and this certainly generates an emotional response. Probably risky in this forum. Thanks for taking the risk.</td>', 'A visceral image. Photography should  be emotive, and this certainly generates an emotional response. Probably risky in this forum. Thanks for taking the risk.', '2004-07-22 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(821256, 91884, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a good workmanlike image. Composition, focus, color and contrast are good. I am bothered a bit (especially looking at the thumbnail) by the dark left corner. Another crop might have improved it.</td>', 'This is a good workmanlike image. Composition, focus, color and contrast are good. I am bothered a bit (especially looking at the thumbnail) by the dark left corner. Another crop might have improved it.', '2004-07-22 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(821268, 90674, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a good, well executed image. Comp, balance, DOF and color are great. The white along the top is a bit blown out. <br/> <br/>The first time something like this was done, it got very good marks for innovation and degree of difficulty. But you don''t have to be a rocket scientist to build the second atom bomb. <br/> <br/>Still, it''s a good image and I gave it a good score.</td>', 'This is a good, well executed image. Comp, balance, DOF and color are great. The white along the top is a bit blown out.  The first time something like this was done, it got very good marks for innovation and degree of difficulty. But you don''t have to be a rocket scientist to build the second atom bomb.  Still, it''s a good image and I gave it a good score.', '2004-07-22 00:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(821272, 92211, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract but the the image feels flat to me. Multiple liught sources and some shadowing would have helped I think.</td>', 'Interesting abstract but the the image feels flat to me. Multiple liught sources and some shadowing would have helped I think.', '2004-07-22 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(821279, 91581, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is a certain balance to the image which fits the challenge well enough. The tatooing is probably the strongest part of the image but you''ve really got to look for it. Beyond that, I''m a little lost. Sorry.</td>', 'There is a certain balance to the image which fits the challenge well enough. The tatooing is probably the strongest part of the image but you''ve really got to look for it. Beyond that, I''m a little lost. Sorry.', '2004-07-22 00:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
