(821378, 92212, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The subject fills the frame nicely and the tight composition really emphasizes the subject. Your shutter speed and stop motion are spot on. The surfer himself seems a little dark on my monitor. Maybe and increase in levels via Pshop to help? Great shot regardless..... 8</td>', 'Great capture. The subject fills the frame nicely and the tight composition really emphasizes the subject. Your shutter speed and stop motion are spot on. The surfer himself seems a little dark on my monitor. Maybe and increase in levels via Pshop to help? Great shot regardless..... 8', '2004-07-22 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(821379, 92147, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and take on the challenge theme. The dof and composition are good. The only thing that I could suggest is to maybe use a filter to reduce the washing effects on the colors that the bright sun has produced. Nice shot regardless.</td>', 'Nice idea and take on the challenge theme. The dof and composition are good. The only thing that I could suggest is to maybe use a filter to reduce the washing effects on the colors that the bright sun has produced. Nice shot regardless.', '2004-07-22 01:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(821385, 91584, 23454, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Great photo - meets the challenge well. The lighting, focus and composition are great!</td>', 'Perfect! Great photo - meets the challenge well. The lighting, focus and composition are great!', '2004-07-22 01:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(821393, 91877, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject and composition. Your use of color desaturation and the interplay of lighting and shadows really makes the subject pop. I also like the low POV used since it highlights the balance point on the subjects skates. One element I found distracting though is the dark line against the backboards. It blends in with the sillouhette of the skater. Nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Wonderful subject and composition. Your use of color desaturation and the interplay of lighting and shadows really makes the subject pop. I also like the low POV used since it highlights the balance point on the subjects skates. One element I found distracting though is the dark line against the backboards. It blends in with the sillouhette of the skater. Nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2004-07-22 01:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(821404, 92019, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. The detail and lighting are nice. Focus seems a tad bit off on the bottom penny, but maybe that''s intentional? Good shot overall.</td>', 'Great macro shot. The detail and lighting are nice. Focus seems a tad bit off on the bottom penny, but maybe that''s intentional? Good shot overall.', '2004-07-22 02:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
