(821584, 92220, 12611, '<td valign="top">there is such a feeling of movement to this shot and it is so alfred hitchcock that is is really nice. I hate to say it but the airplane is not really necessary here and the stark negative space would be just fine. But what the hell, anytime you can compose a beautiful shot and have a plane fly through the picture, I say go for it.- and i guess upon further review the birds do appear to be escaping from the path of teh plane- and yes motion is derived from that so- even better than before!</td>', 'there is such a feeling of movement to this shot and it is so alfred hitchcock that is is really nice. I hate to say it but the airplane is not really necessary here and the stark negative space would be just fine. But what the hell, anytime you can compose a beautiful shot and have a plane fly through the picture, I say go for it.- and i guess upon further review the birds do appear to be escaping from the path of teh plane- and yes motion is derived from that so- even better than before!', '2004-07-22 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(821586, 90886, 22459, '<td valign="top">Shows balance really well but a couple of nit picking faults let it down, the path behind is a little off putting at that angle, you don''t see the face in enough light and the right foot/leg area has some bluriness or compression problems.But it sure does meet the challenge.</td>', 'Shows balance really well but a couple of nit picking faults let it down, the path behind is a little off putting at that angle, you don''t see the face in enough light and the right foot/leg area has some bluriness or compression problems.But it sure does meet the challenge.', '2004-07-22 08:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(821587, 90988, 22459, '<td valign="top">Really good composition perhaps a tad dark  but does add impact specially with the sky as the backdrop. Overall meets the challenge and is a fine image. (8)</td>', 'Really good composition perhaps a tad dark  but does add impact specially with the sky as the backdrop. Overall meets the challenge and is a fine image. (8)', '2004-07-22 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(821588, 91237, 22459, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with plenty going on but iam struggling to see balance.</td>', 'Interesting image with plenty going on but iam struggling to see balance.', '2004-07-22 08:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(821590, 91297, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness of this image. The lighting is awesome. The composition really enhances the solidity of the stone. It infers balance in a really sublime way. The border adds to the image also by creating a "window" through which to view the scene. The artistry of this shot is in the fact that you have not only portrayed but enhanced the architecture of the building so beautifully.</td>', 'I love the starkness of this image. The lighting is awesome. The composition really enhances the solidity of the stone. It infers balance in a really sublime way. The border adds to the image also by creating a "window" through which to view the scene. The artistry of this shot is in the fact that you have not only portrayed but enhanced the architecture of the building so beautifully.', '2004-07-22 08:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(821593, 91797, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Its simplicity speaks for itself. I think the border is too heavy and detracts from the image. The depth of field is effective. I think the central composition doesn''t make the most of the subject. Cropping it offset to one side or something similar may have created just a bit more interest. Great shot though.</td>', 'Great shot. Its simplicity speaks for itself. I think the border is too heavy and detracts from the image. The depth of field is effective. I think the central composition doesn''t make the most of the subject. Cropping it offset to one side or something similar may have created just a bit more interest. Great shot though.', '2004-07-22 08:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(821594, 91892, 23300, '<td valign="top">Really cool image. Somehow the bottles almost gain "personalities" due to the way you set them up. It reminds me of old cartoons where little guys easily pick up great big bad guys. There''s something delightfully quirky about the image. I think a little more white space too the right may have helped just a bit to add a bit more quirkyness.</td>', 'Really cool image. Somehow the bottles almost gain "personalities" due to the way you set them up. It reminds me of old cartoons where little guys easily pick up great big bad guys. There''s something delightfully quirky about the image. I think a little more white space too the right may have helped just a bit to add a bit more quirkyness.', '2004-07-22 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(821595, 91665, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and lighting. I think a bit more white space above and below would balance the image a bit more. I also think that large foreground subjects generally sit better when the image has some sort of border.</td>', 'Great depth of field and lighting. I think a bit more white space above and below would balance the image a bit more. I also think that large foreground subjects generally sit better when the image has some sort of border.', '2004-07-22 08:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
