(821618, 92170, 19130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A little over edited, but stunning none the less.</td>', 'Beautiful. A little over edited, but stunning none the less.', '2004-07-22 09:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(821621, 91033, 19130, '<td valign="top">Nice camera concealment and interesting concept.</td>', 'Nice camera concealment and interesting concept.', '2004-07-22 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(821622, 91667, 23300, '<td valign="top">This shot creates a really idyllic sence of ballance. The composition really helps to push the subject matter. The colour and lighting are almost surreal in nature. A beautiful image.</td>', 'This shot creates a really idyllic sence of ballance. The composition really helps to push the subject matter. The colour and lighting are almost surreal in nature. A beautiful image.', '2004-07-22 09:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(821625, 91987, 19130, '<td valign="top">Burn much? Still amazing. The fisheye effect makes this one stand out amongst the trendiness of recent popular over-post production.</td>', 'Burn much? Still amazing. The fisheye effect makes this one stand out amongst the trendiness of recent popular over-post production.', '2004-07-22 09:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(821626, 91973, 23300, '<td valign="top">Really cool use of the subject matter. The colours are awesome. The composition is excellent. There is nothing subtle about this and it works really well. Even the seam down the middle of the flamingo''s head adds to the "drama". I wouldn''t hang it on one of  my walls but I''m sure there''s a night-club or trendy cafe that would. Well Done.</td>', 'Really cool use of the subject matter. The colours are awesome. The composition is excellent. There is nothing subtle about this and it works really well. Even the seam down the middle of the flamingo''s head adds to the "drama". I wouldn''t hang it on one of  my walls but I''m sure there''s a night-club or trendy cafe that would. Well Done.', '2004-07-22 09:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(821627, 91803, 19130, '<td valign="top">Wine glasses made it interesting. The sword made it amazing.</td>', 'Wine glasses made it interesting. The sword made it amazing.', '2004-07-22 09:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(821629, 92126, 19130, '<td valign="top">I predict that most won''t like this metaphysical definition of balance, but I really like it. Unique.</td>', 'I predict that most won''t like this metaphysical definition of balance, but I really like it. Unique.', '2004-07-22 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(821630, 91366, 16829, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this picture, wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'I like everything about this picture, wouldn''t change a thing.', '2004-07-22 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(821632, 92052, 16829, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this. Surely the most original of the group, and perfectly executed.</td>', 'I like everything about this. Surely the most original of the group, and perfectly executed.', '2004-07-22 09:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(821633, 92137, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really inspiring image. The subject looks quite monolithic which gives the image an almost science fiction type feel. The composition is stunning with the cloud where it is and the use you have made of the light is very clever. This would make an excellent poster.</td>', 'This is a really inspiring image. The subject looks quite monolithic which gives the image an almost science fiction type feel. The composition is stunning with the cloud where it is and the use you have made of the light is very clever. This would make an excellent poster.', '2004-07-22 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(821636, 91366, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition.', '2004-07-22 09:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(821641, 92206, 24441, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2004-07-22 09:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(821701, 92216, 22459, '<td valign="top">Although this is a very good lighthouse shot i don''t think it shows balance well enough.</td>', 'Although this is a very good lighthouse shot i don''t think it shows balance well enough.', '2004-07-22 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(821705, 91675, 8643, '<td valign="top">Spot on challenge and a great photgraph to boot.  Love the warm skin tones and the contemplative expression.  Well done!</td>', 'Spot on challenge and a great photgraph to boot.  Love the warm skin tones and the contemplative expression.  Well done!', '2004-07-22 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(821707, 91619, 22459, '<td valign="top">Without the title this doesn''t represent balance at all. And with the title I still can''t see much balance also the frame is a little bold.</td>', 'Without the title this doesn''t represent balance at all. And with the title I still can''t see much balance also the frame is a little bold.', '2004-07-22 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(821708, 91360, 22459, '<td valign="top">Shows balance well is a very good landscape image with a terrific sky well done.</td>', 'Shows balance well is a very good landscape image with a terrific sky well done.', '2004-07-22 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(821713, 92107, 8367, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that is, but it looks like you''re too close to it. It looks like it could do some damage. Good capture.</td>', 'I''m not sure what that is, but it looks like you''re too close to it. It looks like it could do some damage. Good capture.', '2004-07-22 10:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(821716, 90794, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great job. Simple and clean. Shows balance perfectly.</td>', 'Great job. Simple and clean. Shows balance perfectly.', '2004-07-22 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(821717, 91033, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image with an intriguing hint in the background.  The colouring is great, as is the ckarity of the main subject, offset by the misty base.  An excellent photo on a number of levels.  Minor nitpick, the horizontal break between pink and mauve isn''t, which is a pity.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image with an intriguing hint in the background.  The colouring is great, as is the ckarity of the main subject, offset by the misty base.  An excellent photo on a number of levels.  Minor nitpick, the horizontal break between pink and mauve isn''t, which is a pity.', '2004-07-22 10:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(821720, 91581, 8643, '<td valign="top">Cheeky - just!  An interesting interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Cheeky - just!  An interesting interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-07-22 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(821722, 91529, 22459, '<td valign="top">Sorry I can not see balance but nice macro never the less.</td>', 'Sorry I can not see balance but nice macro never the less.', '2004-07-22 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(821725, 92052, 8643, '<td valign="top">An unusual arrangement, driven by the challenge but very effective.  Beautifully photographed and the fallen flower is a masterpiece, providing interest and balance.  Exqisite lighting and clarity plus balanced colouring.</td>', 'An unusual arrangement, driven by the challenge but very effective.  Beautifully photographed and the fallen flower is a masterpiece, providing interest and balance.  Exqisite lighting and clarity plus balanced colouring.', '2004-07-22 10:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(821726, 90783, 22459, '<td valign="top">Really good idea and done beautifully my only nit pick is that the knife should have been cleaner. Love the play on words in the title.(9)</td>', 'Really good idea and done beautifully my only nit pick is that the knife should have been cleaner. Love the play on words in the title.(9)', '2004-07-22 10:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(821730, 92167, 22459, '<td valign="top">Probably the best image so far in displaying balance and is a neat image on its own. Has you really  looking into it with the road leading you in, probably could have done with  a little tighter crop above but that is just personal preference. (9)</td>', 'Probably the best image so far in displaying balance and is a neat image on its own. Has you really  looking into it with the road leading you in, probably could have done with  a little tighter crop above but that is just personal preference. (9)', '2004-07-22 11:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(821752, 91886, 22459, '<td valign="top">The sense of balance would probably be lost on anyone who has not been out on a fishing boat but i do know how it feels. This is a busy picture with no real subject to focus just a hectic fishing boat but never the less it meets the challenge.</td>', 'The sense of balance would probably be lost on anyone who has not been out on a fishing boat but i do know how it feels. This is a busy picture with no real subject to focus just a hectic fishing boat but never the less it meets the challenge.', '2004-07-22 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(821755, 91987, 23577, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love the postion and the contrast with the clouds in the background! Great use of highlights and shadows!</td>', 'Great shot! I love the postion and the contrast with the clouds in the background! Great use of highlights and shadows!', '2004-07-22 11:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
