(821764, 92147, 22459, '<td valign="top">If your using wood vs steel as your balance as suggested in the title then it is more of a contrast then balance. When i look at this without the title it is not a representation of balance.</td>', 'If your using wood vs steel as your balance as suggested in the title then it is more of a contrast then balance. When i look at this without the title it is not a representation of balance.', '2004-07-22 11:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
