(821783, 92123, 22459, '<td valign="top">Ive looked and looked you really have me sucked in. All i can think is that it is an extreme macro of sugar cubes or something similiar it just looks to plastic for ice. Besides all that this shows balance and will have a lot people confused , well done.</td>', 'Ive looked and looked you really have me sucked in. All i can think is that it is an extreme macro of sugar cubes or something similiar it just looks to plastic for ice. Besides all that this shows balance and will have a lot people confused , well done.', '2004-07-22 11:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(821787, 92074, 22459, '<td valign="top">On another challenge this may have done well but it is not a good representative of balance.</td>', 'On another challenge this may have done well but it is not a good representative of balance.', '2004-07-22 11:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
