(823082, 92107, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool bug.  Couple things I see that I don''t like about the photo.  He''s crawling (or appears to be) away from you.  Moving side to side isn''t all bad, but he seems to be going sideways and a little bit away from the camera.  The other thing is that you''ve given him no room on the left side of the frame to move.  IMO, there should be a bit more room on the left side to accomodate his body and to give him somewhere to go.  Good colors and good find<br/></td>', 'Cool bug.  Couple things I see that I don''t like about the photo.  He''s crawling (or appears to be) away from you.  Moving side to side isn''t all bad, but he seems to be going sideways and a little bit away from the camera.  The other thing is that you''ve given him no room on the left side of the frame to move.  IMO, there should be a bit more room on the left side to accomodate his body and to give him somewhere to go.  Good colors and good find', '2004-07-23 11:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
