(823097, 91989, 3540, '<td valign="top">The key to these figure shots is the lighting.  This is pretty good.  I think you could''ve added a little drama by lighting it with a spotlight and having a lighted spot on the floor with the shadow of the figure near the center of it.  Not that it NEEDS it, but just a thought.</td>', 'The key to these figure shots is the lighting.  This is pretty good.  I think you could''ve added a little drama by lighting it with a spotlight and having a lighted spot on the floor with the shadow of the figure near the center of it.  Not that it NEEDS it, but just a thought.', '2004-07-23 11:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
