(824537, 92133, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is one of the only flower pictures in this challenge that suggests balance (on the water). Title is too generic, doesn''t say anything to me (besides the topic, which is already known).</td>', 'This is one of the only flower pictures in this challenge that suggests balance (on the water). Title is too generic, doesn''t say anything to me (besides the topic, which is already known).', '2004-07-25 05:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
