(825137, 92105, 22734, '<td valign="top">I voted a few days ago. Back for comments.<br/>Yes: these guys are balancing gurus. The subject is well lit. I would have cropped this differently, but then it would have been a different picture. With the way the sweet girl is placed, I would cropped right above her head: a perfect 8x10. Now, if I wanted to keep her in, I would have changed angle to include a little more of her face.  However, the cat solo is a very strong visual. The lighting is so good, it needs no support whatsoever. Bumping this image to 6.</td>', 'I voted a few days ago. Back for comments.Yes: these guys are balancing gurus. The subject is well lit. I would have cropped this differently, but then it would have been a different picture. With the way the sweet girl is placed, I would cropped right above her head: a perfect 8x10. Now, if I wanted to keep her in, I would have changed angle to include a little more of her face.  However, the cat solo is a very strong visual. The lighting is so good, it needs no support whatsoever. Bumping this image to 6.', '2004-07-25 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(825149, 91987, 3540, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.  Great work with this one.  The toning is perfect</td>', 'My favorite so far.  Great work with this one.  The toning is perfect', '2004-07-25 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(825151, 92123, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like a mirror trick to me.  Not badly done, but it needs the lighting right to make somre real drama here.  The colors don''t contrast enough<br/></td>', 'Looks like a mirror trick to me.  Not badly done, but it needs the lighting right to make somre real drama here.  The colors don''t contrast enough', '2004-07-25 22:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
