(825210, 92059, 7485, '<td valign="top">I know, I know, you must have had to sharpen it a lot because the bird was probably a little blurred. But the white halo, specially around the beak, is really distracting. Superb moment though, well worth hand-editing to get rid of the halo - 7</td>', 'I know, I know, you must have had to sharpen it a lot because the bird was probably a little blurred. But the white halo, specially around the beak, is really distracting. Superb moment though, well worth hand-editing to get rid of the halo - 7', '2004-07-25 23:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
