(825686, 91366, 16148, '<td valign="top">My first ribbon!   Thanks for all the comments and high scores.  I did over sharpen a little while trying to bring out the egg shell texture.  Maybe I''ll go back and redo the post processing on this one.  I was asked to validate this picture during the challenge.  I guess because the egg is balanced on the edge of the bowl.  I actually drained that egg so it''s just an empty shell and was very light.  There is a hole about the size if a dime on the back side.  I then used a small piece of adhesive putty to keep the egg in place.  Nothing fancy but it worked well.  I''m happy with this shot and am glad it was well received.</td>', 'My first ribbon!   Thanks for all the comments and high scores.  I did over sharpen a little while trying to bring out the egg shell texture.  Maybe I''ll go back and redo the post processing on this one.  I was asked to validate this picture during the challenge.  I guess because the egg is balanced on the edge of the bowl.  I actually drained that egg so it''s just an empty shell and was very light.  There is a hole about the size if a dime on the back side.  I then used a small piece of adhesive putty to keep the egg in place.  Nothing fancy but it worked well.  I''m happy with this shot and am glad it was well received.', '2004-07-26 07:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
