(1430905, 91987, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome shot, I can´t believe I haven´t seen it before.  The best wedding shot I have ever seen and makes me wish you had photographed my wedding 3 years ago.  I obviously didn´t vote on this one since I hadn´t discovered this site at this time but I would have given it a 10.</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome shot, I can´t believe I haven´t seen it before.  The best wedding shot I have ever seen and makes me wish you had photographed my wedding 3 years ago.  I obviously didn´t vote on this one since I hadn´t discovered this site at this time but I would have given it a 10.', '2005-06-03 07:50:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1431072, 91987, 29636, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT IMAGE!! So much emotion and love! I hope I get a shot like this from my wedding by ''ace flyman'' (no pressure joe...lol).<br/> <br/>A well deserved kudo on the lense selection and composition.<br/>Dave</td>', 'EXCELLENT IMAGE!! So much emotion and love! I hope I get a shot like this from my wedding by ''ace flyman'' (no pressure joe...lol). A well deserved kudo on the lense selection and composition.Dave', '2005-06-03 10:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
