(2104145, 91987, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Pure Poetry!</b> <br/>Thank you for the privilege of participating in a community of such World-Class Artists!  At times I feel like a preschooler among PHDs, but I don''t let that discourage me.  <br/>The way I figure it, if you stand close enough to an artist, you''ll get some paint on your sleeve!<br/>Thanks for the sepia-colored mark!...I''ll never wash this shirt again!!!<br/>:) Stan</td>', 'Pure Poetry! Thank you for the privilege of participating in a community of such World-Class Artists!  At times I feel like a preschooler among PHDs, but I don''t let that discourage me.  The way I figure it, if you stand close enough to an artist, you''ll get some paint on your sleeve!Thanks for the sepia-colored mark!...I''ll never wash this shirt again!!!:) Stan', '2006-01-31 00:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2842604, 92055, 58290, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic. Great idea and well executed. Thanks for your comment on mine. Yours too looks like an ad :-)</td>', 'Very cool pic. Great idea and well executed. Thanks for your comment on mine. Yours too looks like an ad :-)', '2006-09-17 14:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3290437, 91987, 53892, '<td valign="top">Wow. I love your wedding shots. I need to make some wedding sample books. Could I have your permission to use couple of your photo''s? I would put you rname on them of course. I am making up a couple of sample books to display the hardbound coffee table books I sell, and need some wedding books for wedding shows.<br/> <br/>I love the second place you just got--congrats!!<br/> <br/>my website is <a href="//www.tellthatstory.com." rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.tellthatstory.com.</a> I give everyone from DPChallenge a free account. CHeck it out--I would be using your pictures in a designer 8x8, photo journals, or a designer 12x12.<br/> <br/>Sincerely,<br/> <br/>Chinpaca ( Kathy G)</td>', 'Wow. I love your wedding shots. I need to make some wedding sample books. Could I have your permission to use couple of your photo''s? I would put you rname on them of course. I am making up a couple of sample books to display the hardbound coffee table books I sell, and need some wedding books for wedding shows. I love the second place you just got--congrats!! my website is //www.tellthatstory.com. I give everyone from DPChallenge a free account. CHeck it out--I would be using your pictures in a designer 8x8, photo journals, or a designer 12x12. Sincerely, Chinpaca ( Kathy G)', '2007-01-27 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 0);
